{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/TheViableEdge/status/2103494684374900862","id":"2103494684374900862","text":"I made a real time visualizer with Opus 5.5 and Jev that makes simple data visuals, real time effects, and theme changes. \n\nI'm hoping to use this for making social shorts with live graphics overlays so cut out that tedious editing work.\n\nI can give it any kind of artifact, a performance report, lesson plan, presentation and it will break down all of the content into items that can be summoned on queue. \n\nI'm running wild with ideas, everything from storytelling for kids, teaching, sales pitches, language learning.","raw_text":{"text":"I made a real time visualizer with Opus 5.5 and Jev that makes simple data visuals, real time effects, and theme changes. \n\nI'm hoping to use this for making social shorts with live graphics overlays so cut out that tedious editing work.\n\nI can give it any kind of artifact, a performance report, lesson plan, presentation and it will break down all of the content into items that can be summoned on queue. \n\nI'm running wild with ideas, everything from storytelling for kids, teaching, sales pitches, language learning.","display_text_range":[0,520],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[277,300],"id":"2103493468995653632","display":"pic.x.com/YhldvxbM0K","original":"https://t.co/YhldvxbM0K","replacement":"https://x.com/TheViableEdge/status/2103494684374900862/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"TheViableEdge","url":"https://x.com/TheViableEdge","id":"1965464182964281344","followers":1352,"following":482,"likes":870,"media_count":177,"name":"Adam Sandler","description":"Founder, The Viable Edge. I partner with teams to give their brands a durable knowledge base. Free community: http://skool.com/ai-marketing-lab-6852","raw_description":{"text":"Founder, The Viable Edge. I partner with teams to give their brands a durable knowledge base. Free community: https://t.co/Et4O8dQedS","facets":[{"type":"ur